<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0094/e_0103> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/PatientCondition> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0094/tu_0004> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "In a first-degree relative of a DCM/HNDCM patient, an ECG, and an echocardiogram are recommended if: • the index patient was diagnosed <50 years of age or has clinical features suggestive of an inherited cause, or • there is family history of DCM/HNDCM, or premature unexpected SD." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0094/tu_0009> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0094/e_0050> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_d1710bde778e9e1be7f11ed2fef05ae0e7ef558d8677a37c27ae7f454230f712_n0094/e_0102/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingMethod> "NONE" .
